    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topiopolis is a medieval world-building game based on accumulating and arranging tiles in the right places. You unlock new tiles when you place them next to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will earn new tiles with each new tile found. Each new tile discovered will give you 5 random tiles to place. Each scoring level will also give you 1 additional tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile also has a tile score that you can increase by placing other tiles around it. But be careful, because the bonuses won't be the same each time, and you'll need to place your tiles in the best way to get the best score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, a forest will develop a better score if it has other forest tiles around it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Topiopolis is a medieval world-building game based on accumulating and arranging tiles in the right places. You unlock new tiles when you place them next to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will earn new tiles with each new tile found. Each new tile discovered will give you 5 random tiles to place. Each scoring level will also give you 1 additional tile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tile also has a tile score that you can increase by placing other tiles around it. But be careful, because the bonuses won't be the same each time, and you'll need to place your tiles in the best way to get the best score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, a forest will develop a better score if it has other forest tiles around it.</p>",
